  "description": "Albert Blake has lived with just one purpose: to avenge his father by killing the master of the cursed Valdez mansion. But when Albert infiltrates the mansion as a new servant, he begins to see through his father’s lies. Master Asha Valdez is nothing like the hideous monster his father portrayed him to be, but rather an immortal vampire whose beauty captivates Albert at first glance, just like it had for his father. As Albert soon finds out, he is far from the first Blake to come to Asha, as his blood has been drawn to the master for generations...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
